{
  "dom_id": "step-187828",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Finding the Formula for the Nth Term of an Arithmetic Sequence in Function Notation",
  "problem": "Find the formula for the $n$th term of an arithmetic sequence if the first term is $0$ and the second term is $-2.$ Express your answer in function notation.",
  "worked_solution": "The formula for the $n$th term of an arithmetic sequence (in function notation) is\n\n$$\nf(n)= f(1)+(n-1)d.\n$$\n\nWe are given the first term $f(1)={\\color{blue}0}.$ Also, the common difference of the sequence can be found as\n\n$$\nd=-2 - 0 = {\\color{red}-2}.\n$$\n\nSo, we substitute into the formula and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\nf(n)&= f(1)+(n-1)d \\[3pt]\n&= {\\color{blue}0} + (n - 1)({\\color{red}-2})  \\[3pt]\n&= 0 - 2n + 2 \\[3pt]\n&= 2 - 2n\n}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the formula for the $n$th term is $f(n) = 2 - 2n.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-187828\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"187828\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14384\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-187828\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Finding the Formula for the Nth Term of an Arithmetic Sequence in Function Notation</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"187828\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                  